# Derived from the IANA Special-Purpose Address Registries. (2025-10-09)
# Rule: deny every block with Globally Reachable = FALSE.
#   https://www.iana.org/assignments/iana-ipv4-special-registry
#   https://www.iana.org/assignments/iana-ipv6-special-registry
#
# 127.0.0.0/8, ::1/128 and 169.254.1.1 are omitted since they correspond to
# loopback addresses and the DNS forwarder, which are allowed uncoditionally.
#
# This list should kept up to date with IANA standards.

# --- IPv4 ---
# "This network"                        RFC 791
0.0.0.0/8
# Private-Use                           RFC 1918
10.0.0.0/8
# Shared Address Space (CGNAT)          RFC 6598
100.64.0.0/10
# Link Local (cloud metadata lives here) RFC 3927
169.254.0.0/16
# Private-Use                           RFC 1918
172.16.0.0/12
# IETF Protocol Assignments             RFC 6890 §2.1
192.0.0.0/24
# Documentation (TEST-NET-1)            RFC 5737
192.0.2.0/24
# 6a44-relay anycast                    RFC 6751
192.88.99.2/32
# Private-Use                           RFC 1918
192.168.0.0/16
# Benchmarking                          RFC 2544
198.18.0.0/15
# Documentation (TEST-NET-2)            RFC 5737
198.51.100.0/24
# Documentation (TEST-NET-3)            RFC 5737
203.0.113.0/24
# Reserved (includes Limited Broadcast, RFC 919) RFC 1112 §4
240.0.0.0/4

